# Yerwada Smart Building BMS Simulator - Environment Configuration

# Production / Vercel:
# The frontend runs entirely client-side as a high-performance Single Page Application (SPA).
# The simulation engine runs directly in the browser with deterministic thermodynamic cycles.

# Optional: Default loopback URL for local host monitoring agent (defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8765)
# VITE_LOCAL_AGENT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765

# Python Agent Configuration (set in terminal before launching agent if needed):
# BMS_DEVICE_ID=IT-MAC-001             # Optional: Override generated device ID
# BMS_AGENT_TOKEN=your_custom_token     # Optional: Pre-set pairing token
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://my-domain.com # Optional: Additional CORS allowed origins
